  "description": "The beautiful Duke Enrico Michele approached like a devil whispering sweet lies, offering a cunning deal. \"Just dance for me like a living doll. In return, I'll tell you about your dead parents.\" Along with his mysterious patronage came a chilling question: \"Don't you want to know the truth?\" And so began my secret, dangerous entanglement with the Duke, a meeting that should never have happened.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
